<Button x:Name="BtnPresetAllExceptGpuLan" Height="30" Cursor="Hand" BorderThickness="0" Margin="0,0,0,6" ToolTip="Enable the recommended FiveM Optimize profile. It selects all performance tweaks while allowing you to still pick your LAN/WiFi and GPU type.">
